WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:06.000
To me, the world was boredom itself.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:10.810
I kept watching it apathetically.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.840
The scorching summer.
The freezing winter.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.450
Spring passed, autumn came.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.080
The four seasons simply repeated themselves boringly.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:27.860
Like a pinwheel that spins bluntly, only time passes by.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.860
To me, the world never changed.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:37.370
Nothing irritated or stirred my heart.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:41.400
The same monochromatic days would unfold upon me.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.240
I truly was bored with such a world.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.710
That is, until I met her.

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:01.560
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:10.970
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:28.280
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:35.360
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:41.960
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:49.770
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:54.440
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.310
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.620
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:07.360
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:11.630
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:14.530
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:21.100
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.010
Memories of Cherry Blossoms!

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.010
Keita, please be gentle.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.620
Don't move around too much.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.650
But it hurts.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:38.920
Can't help it. You started this.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.020
It's embarrassing.
Don't stare too much.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.760
Don't move.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.800
But...

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.130
Oh, you were here, Hake?

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.940
Yes, for a while now.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.910
Anyway, what are you two doing?

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.310
She played with the cats in the neighborhood,

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.340
and got fleas on her tail.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.380
Don't look at my sullied self.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.050
There, there.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:11.950
Very sorry to bother you.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.690
I'm only here to deliver this letter.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.490
What's that?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.130
An invitation to the family head's birthday party tomorrow.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.070
Then, excuse me.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:27.170
So he ran away, from the female flea demon.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:34.440
Oh my, I wonder if I was too cold.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.850
I hope she recovers soon.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.880
It's regrettable, but I can't handle fleas.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:44.590
Now then, I must hurry since there are a few more places to visit.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:52.860
Igusa, is the pumpkin puree ready?

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:55.130
Yes, just a little bit more.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.700
Tayune, you must turn off the stove now.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.140
Everyone, we don't have much time.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.010
Keep your hands moving.

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.680
Got it.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.580
Tensou, I'll decorate, so could you hold the ladder?

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.390
Oh, righty.

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:17.890
I will do it.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.890
Wait, not you.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.920
Stop it, hey!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.260
Ouch.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.200
Are you okay?

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:32.470
Mr. Hake, thank you for your work.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.370
Oh, Tomohane.
You're working hard too.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:40.680
No, I'm really happy I could be of help to the family head.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.050
You're a nice kid, Tomohane.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.780
Tomohane, hurry up.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.680
Okay, I got it. I'm coming.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.820
See you later, Mr. Hake.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.970
You're still awake?

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.640
Oh, Hake. You want to play too?

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.740
I politely refuse.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:13.180
There will be many guests tomorrow.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.350
Please make sure you get enough rest.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.260
Please. I know it is reckless.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.130
I apologize for my rudeness.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.730
But I don't have time.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.330
What's wrong?

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.240
Mr. Hake.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.040
Actually...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.040
I understand.
It is such short notice.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:51.450
I apologize for not coming on a contracted day.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.680
But I don't have time!

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.880
Inukami, please listen to me!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.320
My friend is being targeted by the Reaper.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.190
I beg of you, lend me your strength!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:02.990
Reaper?

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:04.560
That is unfortunate.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.160
What's wrong? Nobody will help?

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.000
They heartlessly toy with death.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.630
They're an enemy of
Inukami and the Kawahiras.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.470
But, even if you say so...

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:19.210
It is forbidden to fight together with a contractless one.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.480
And the opponent is too tough.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.520
I see.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.920
I got it. Sorry for bothering you.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.090
See you later.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.590
Are you going alone?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.730
That's right.
I'm the only one who can help.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:54.810
How reckless to come other than on contract day.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.850
In the end, we might be abandoning her.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.720
We can't help it.
She's too irrational.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.490
I can't wait for tomorrow.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:14.000
It's almost done.
Everyone, keep it up.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.380
It's finally done.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.920
The cooking and decorations.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:38.120
Happy birthday

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.990
Well done.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:45.990
Thanks to you, it'll be a great banquet.

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:58.240
Such fine weather.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.450
Hey, Hake. We're here.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:10.020
Oh my, Master Keita.
You came pretty early.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:13.460
She kept nagging me to come early.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:17.030
Isn't it better to enjoy a festival early on?

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:19.800
I want to see the fun from the start.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.270
Then please relax before it starts.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.470
I'll serve some tea.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.370
By the way, is Kaoru coming?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.070
No, he's not coming today.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.140
He was here until yesterday, though.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:36.080
Oh come on, it's Grandma's birthday.

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.910
He has his duties as a Kawahira.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:43.550
So how are Kaoru's Inukami doing?

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:45.250
Their master is gone.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.520
Oh, right.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:50.430
They have been ordered by Master Kaoru last night

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:52.760
and did their best preparing.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.430
They are asleep now.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.270
They're all asleep, huh?

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:02.800
Then I believe I have to pay them a visit immediately.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:06.580
Keita, going to make a move on them again?

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.910
I want to see Nadeshiko asleep in sexy lingerie.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.780
Hey wait, Keita.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:12.650
Charge!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.580
- Keita, stop!
- They never change.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.290
Other than being brash,

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:23.260
that reckless energy is just like a certain someone in their youth.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.740
Why did you follow me?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:43.580
Oh, I thought that since none of us followed you,

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.310
you were holding a grudge.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:50.420
Idiot. I wouldn't hold a grudge for that!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:51.920
Everyone is scared.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:55.790
And you? Aren't you afraid?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.460
The Reaper is the worst and strongest being.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.470
A young and inexperienced human like you

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.700
has no chance to win alone.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.000
You will simply be killed.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.540
Why are you laughing?

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.980
No, forgive me.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.280
But I have to go.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:20.450
Even if I'm afraid or there's no chance of victory.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:25.450
Why do you wish to fight the Reaper knowing that?

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:29.490
Simple. So I can live a noble life.

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:31.790
Noble?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:34.000
Listen, white Inukami.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:39.900
The Reaper has indeed defeated many members of the Kawahira family.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.700
But even so...

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:45.810
I will not ignore my friend who is cowering in fear.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:50.180
I have sworn to myself that I would be a hero.

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:53.350
I will not yield to what is unfair.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.550
That's why.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:59.550
No matter the disadvantage... Charge!

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.860
How interesting.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.800
That ornament is beautiful.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.100
May I have it?

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.570
If I may, I will form a contract with you.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.140
What?

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.170
My name is Hake.

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:23.650
If you will free me from this eternal boredom,

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.820
I shall accompany you wherever.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.090
Ever since then,

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:36.790
I have run along beside you.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:51.070
Lights on.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:53.810
Congratulations

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:01.650
Please wait here.
Your escort will be here soon.

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:05.190
All right everyone, over here.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.520
Family head, happy birthday.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.430
Happy birthday!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:15.630
Igusa.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:19.400
We're running out of beers.
Can you help bring them?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.170
Okay.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.840
Now then.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.140
I wonder how the other guests are doing.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.080
Cheers.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:30.080
But I'm still in high school so it's just juice.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:30.910
Here.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.080
Master Keita...

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.650
What's wrong, Hake?

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.250
Why are you on this side?

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:44.390
Well, it just feels more comfortable here.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.760
Hey, Gokyoya.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.700
One more hot sake for this lady here, and this grilled meat for me.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:55.600
That meat is for the monsters.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.840
It's not something for normal humans.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.940
I don't care as long as it's good.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.280
Master Keita sure is interesting.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.780
Here's your drink.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:07.420
All right, I'm going to dance.

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:18.430
I really don't understand what he is thinking.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.860
He's either a genius or a fool.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.110
Have you lost your mind, too?

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:34.680
Look.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:39.920
Geez, why are we the only ones working this hard?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.820
Oh my, do you dislike working hard?

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:44.690
You're one lazy fellow.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:45.820
That's not it.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.660
I don't mean it that way.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:51.190
I'm glad I could be of use to the family head.

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:55.500
But I was wondering why we are the only ones helping.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.800
What do you mean?

00:13:56.800 --> 00:14:00.800
Basically, you know, there's that one useless person.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.340
Oh, her.

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:05.610
Yoko is way too rough to help.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.810
She would only be in the way.

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:10.510
Hey Imari, you just revealed her name.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:13.580
I did? How rude of me.

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.520
Well, I guess that's true.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.690
It's much better if she's not here.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.060
Yoko.

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:26.630
I'm sorry for not realizing.

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:28.500
Uh, that's...

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.970
You're totally right.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.700
I should've helped out, too.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:35.240
I'm sorry.

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:36.910
What are you doing?

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.580
I'm really sorry.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.190
Is it delicious, Marro?

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.520
Tomohane.

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.330
Mr. Hake.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.790
Don't mind me.
Are you sharing your food?

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:06.170
Yes. It's a celebratory day after all, so I think Marro should have some too.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.840
It's a really nice birthday party.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:14.080
Everybody came and they're happy for the family head's long life.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:20.650
Is something bothering you, Mr. Hake?

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:23.050
Why? Do I appear that way?

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:25.590
Yes, a little.

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:27.520
I guess you're right.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:31.330
This season makes me wonder about many things.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.330
Especially this day...

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.330
Today?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.600
Yes.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:41.340
The first time I met with the family head was exactly on this day.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:48.580
Phew, handling drunken men is really tiring.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.280
Great job.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:55.620
What are Mr. Hake and
Tomohane doing over there?

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:56.850
Well...

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:04.160
Nadeshiko, Sendan, and Tomohane.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:08.230
Do you like your master, Master Kaoru?

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.170
Yes.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:15.670
Of course.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:17.110
I love him.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:19.170
That's good to hear.

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:22.180
Please treasure your time with him.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.390
It seems like she has calmed down.

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:38.060
Poor girl, she must've been scared while I was not with her.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.830
Is it not the time yet?

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:45.700
If what the Reaper said after the fight was true, then it'll be soon.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.870
It said it'll kill everyone next time.

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:52.170
Let me confirm one last time.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.640
From a human's point of view,

00:16:55.640 --> 00:17:00.050
a Reaper will make weird contracts and take incomprehensible actions.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:02.750
It might seem ridiculous,

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.720
but it is the most dangerous monster to fight.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.890
Don't ever put your guard down.

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:11.860
Yeah, I learned that the hard way yesterday.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:31.850
I just remembered.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:36.550
Today is my birthday.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.590
White guy... I mean Hake.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.620
Once this fight is over...

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.590
Let's celebrate my birthday together.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.000
I got it.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.800
I'd be honored to.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:51.730
Right. I'm going to live for another fifty years.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.870
Make sure you celebrate it every year.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:58.940
Please leave it to me.
I'll bake cakes and cook up feasts.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:02.680
Here it comes.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.080
Purification Barrier Type 2.
Purple Pillar.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:13.490
I call you in the name of Kasan Soukun.

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:15.520
Flashing lights and darkness...

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.530
Combine and destroy everything!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:32.840
Look out.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.410
Are you hurt?

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.180
- Nope.
- But...

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.420
I told you, right?

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:46.720
Those who take lives as they please...

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.320
Those who continue to make others shriek...

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:53.060
I will not yield to such unfair things.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.830
Follow me, Hake.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.670
Even after that, many things happened.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:03.770
Many great things.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:07.810
We risked our lives more than just once or twice.

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.050
But it's strange.

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:15.620
As I recall those events, all of them were fun memories.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.290
I had fun.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.760
But one day, everything will come to an end.

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:27.000
I wonder why humans are so short-lived compared to us.

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.460
How many more times

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.200
will I be able to see these cherry blossoms together with her?

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:38.010
Our happy times are sadly very short.

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.710
Just like the petals of a cherry tree.

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:45.610
While it is very fun, one day we must bid farewell.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:48.820
The more fun it was, the more sad we will feel.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:53.690
But something will remain.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.690
Look, Mr. Hake.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.660
So you're here, Hake.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:00.700
Master Kayano.

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:04.400
Hey, everyone. Over here.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:06.200
The cherry blossoms are in full bloom.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:11.010
Drink away, everyone.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:13.910
Please, just enjoy yourselves.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.980
Missy. You're so cute.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:24.450
Keita, must you hit on every single girl you see?

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:36.160
You always have so much energy.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:42.400
Of course, I'm still going to live for another fifty years.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.810
Come along, Hake.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.980
You really are greedy.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.650
But sure.

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:57.620
I'll accompany you till the end.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:59.920
Don't get in my way.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.160
Get your hands off that faceless ghost.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.160
Hey, watch it.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:08.430
That Keita sure is rough and a bit reckless.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.960
I wonder where he got it.

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:11.970
Indeed.

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.040
Her beauty is unreal.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.800
Obviously. She's not a human!

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:19.170
Where did he get it from, I wonder...

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.680
Keita, you idiot!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:43.100
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.610
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:58.810
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.080
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:04.620
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.790
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.530
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:16.360
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.070
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.650
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Let's fight</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:41.990
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.040
Inukami!

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.970
See you!

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:55.800
Next episode preview

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:59.940
The painting by Delacroix, "Liberty Leading the People".

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:01.880
It depicts a woman

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:05.780
guiding the people through the flames of the French Revolution.

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:09.620
It's a Goddess exposing her breast while carrying a flag.

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:12.950
I can hear her fiery spirit shout.

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:15.820
"Look at me more, please."

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:17.890
Next on Inukami!

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:20.230
"Beg to be Exhausted!"

00:23:20.230 --> 00:23:24.330
Look, Kawahira, it's your great predecessor.

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:25.000
Beg to be Exhausted!
